From efa69ce7e1fc86c77e3462305161748386008d6c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Destrudos6 <3411622425@qq.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 22:13:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Narrow the Baidu auth-scheme fallback to real rejections

The automatic scheme detection caught any TranslationConfigException
from the Bearer attempt and pinned the sign scheme, but that exception
also covers quota exhaustion (54004), unsupported languages (58001)
and a closed service (58002). When one of those hit mid-translation,
the working Bearer authentication was poisoned in the cache, every
following request went through the sign scheme, and API-key users
ended up on a misleading 54001 'check your credentials' instead of
the real error.

Only a 54001 rejection of the Bearer token may trigger the fallback
now; every other configuration error surfaces directly with its true
meaning.
---
 .../org/schabi/newpipe/bisub/SubtitleTranslator.java   | 10 ++++++++--
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/app/src/main/java/org/schabi/newpipe/bisub/SubtitleTranslator.java b/app/src/main/java/org/schabi/newpipe/bisub/SubtitleTranslator.java
index ee78df54a..dea2f1344 100644
--- a/app/src/main/java/org/schabi/newpipe/bisub/SubtitleTranslator.java
+++ b/app/src/main/java/org/schabi/newpipe/bisub/SubtitleTranslator.java
@@ -792,10 +792,16 @@ public final class SubtitleTranslator {
                         baiduSendWithRetries(joined, target, appId, secret, true);
                 BAIDU_BEARER_AUTH.put(appId, true);
                 return parsed;
-            } catch (final BaiduAuthException | TranslationConfigException e) {
+            } catch (final BaiduAuthException e) {
                 // The Bearer scheme was rejected (the key field holds the
                 // classic secret, or the token is invalid): continue with
-                // the sign scheme instead.
+                // the sign scheme instead. Only a 54001 rejection may pin
+                // the scheme: any other configuration error (quota, closed
+                // service, unsupported language) also arrives as a
+                // TranslationConfigException, but those have nothing to do
+                // with the authentication scheme, and treating them as a
+                // Bearer rejection would poison the cache and mask the
+                // real error behind a misleading sign-scheme 54001.
                 BAIDU_BEARER_AUTH.put(appId, false);
                 BisubLog.w("baidu bearer auth was rejected (" + e.getMessage()
                         + "), switching to the sign scheme");
-- 
